  "description": {
    "text": "A half deck released in Japan on 19 July 2003 with the film Jirachi: Wish Maker. It holds Forina's Jirachi and other Pokémon of Forina, Pokémon of Butler, a key character of the film, such as Butler's Salamence and Dusclops, and Trainers including Butler's Magic Trick and Wish Maker, with a rulebook, damage and status counters and a Jirachi coin. It is the only one of the movie VS Packs without a Pokémon of Ash, May or Brock.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Movie Commemoration VS Pack (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 14 August 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260814171726/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Movie_Commemoration_VS_Pack_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A black \"Vs\" symbol at the bottom right, and a number out of 019",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game 30th Anniversary Archive (The Pokémon Company): each card's expansion mark",
        "url": "https://www.30tharchive.pokemon-card.com/"
      },
      {
